WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.920
Down-forward heavy punch hits Juri late as she rises.

2
00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:01.270
Crouching light punch links after the meaty overhead.

3
00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:01.820
Standing light punch follows the crouching jab.

4
00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:03.320
Light Spinning Bird Kick follows the standing jab.

5
00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:03.820
Juri recovers after the light SBK ender.
